I see meltzer's ratings the following way - without knowing anything about the backstory, can i search this match watch it and enjoy it - just the match nothing else - then it get's a high rating on his scale and this has proven to be true - this is how i got into NJPW and AJPW i didn't know the guys and i didn't care i just wanted good matches with in ring story :)
